{
	"_comment": "The game's own items, not classic's (ItemDB merges them), and what vendors sell of them besides their classic stock (VendorWindow.vendor_data). Classic has no helm below level 25 but the Red Defias Mask, so these give the cloth, leather and mail wearers one each around Harrowfield's levels: white vendor gear at item level 13, armour and price worked out from the classic vendor sets of item level 10 (Knitted, Rough Leather) and 5 (Dull Ringmail) scaled to item level 13 and by the head slot's share of the chest's (13 to 16). No plate: classic gives plate only from level 40. Bags: 900700-900721, one for every even size from 6 to 48 slots (quality by size), 6 and 8 sold at every starting area's provisioner, 10 and 12 too in the second towns; 14 and up drop in the world (WorldDrops).",
